Tree map
It is introduced in jdk 1.2 version
It is a collection of key-value pairs
It is a Map interface implementation
It is a non-synchronized class
It is not a direct legacy map
it is direct implementation class to navigate map, where navigation map is the child interface to sortedmap. where sortedmap is child to the interface that is tree map must implement all the methods of navigation map.
Treemap dont follow insertion order.
It is able to follow osrting order
It is able to allow only homogenious elements.
It is able to allow null key and value.

